<title>USA: QualMed Plans to drop out of Pa. Medicaid.</title>
<headline>QualMed Plans to drop out of Pa. Medicaid.</headline>
<dateline>PHILADELPHIA 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>QualMed Plans for Health Inc said Tuesday it will withdraw from participation in the Pennsylvania Medicaid program, effective January 1, 1997.</p>
<p>QualMed, a subsidiary of Health Systems International Inc, said it will help Medicaid members find a new carrier.</p>
<p>QualMed President and Chief Executive Robert Bruce said the company's &quot;long-term plans will be best served by our withdrawal.&quot;</p>
</text>
